{% doc %}
The merchant's own logo for the guarantee tab, or nothing.

Arrives the same way the name does -- an app-data metafield, read in Liquid
before any script of ours runs, so the tab is right on the first render
rather than swapping our mark for theirs a moment later.

Outputs nothing at all when the merchant has set no logo, which is what
lets the caller fall back to our asset. Unescaped, like the name snippet:
every caller escapes once where it lands.
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  assign kourify_logo = app.metafields.kourify.brand_logo.value | default: '' | strip
  echo kourify_logo
-%}
